{"content":[{"c":["KIDON*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Threshing floor where Uzzah was struck down by God as he attempted to steady the ark of the covenant (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.13.9","r":"1Chr.13.9","rawR":"1Chr.13.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.13.9","value":"1Chr.13.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 13:9"},", ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," mg). The parallel passage in ",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.6.6","r":"2Sam.6.6","rawR":"2Sam.6.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.6.6","value":"2Sam.6.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Samuel 6:6"}," refers to this place as “the threshing floor of Nacon.” Following the death of Uzzah, the place was renamed Perez-uzzah, which means either “the breach of Uzzah” or “the outbreak against Uzzah” (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.6.8","r":"2Sam.6.8","rawR":"2Sam.6.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.6.8","value":"2Sam.6.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 6:8"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.13.11","r":"1Chr.13.11","rawR":"1Chr.13.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.13.11","value":"1Chr.13.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 13:11"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Kidon","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 13:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.13.9","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.13.9","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.13.9"},{"anchorText":"2 Samuel 6:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.6.6","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.6.6","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.6.6"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 6:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.6.8","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.6.8","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.6.8"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 13:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.13.11","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.13.11","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.13.11"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"cbcb80aa12d0